                                "text": "maechler@stat.math.ethz.ch",
                                "unsafe": true
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ") changed:\n\n           What    |Removed                     |Added\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                 CC|                            |maechler@stat.math.ethz.ch\n\n--- Comment #4 from Martin Maechler ("
                            },
